{"id":"wb-7-1165","name":"寿圣寺双塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"寿圣寺双塔","text":"寿圣寺双塔为位于河南省郑州市中牟县黄店镇冉家村的两座古塔。双塔的始建年代已无考，但根据塔的建筑风格和结构，应为北宋晚期建筑。寿圣寺双塔于1986年被列为第二批河南省文物保护单位，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AF%BF%E5%9C%A3%E5%AF%BA%E5%8F%8C%E5%A1%94","revisionId":85616027,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85616027","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/fc28d26d5ed5f240476742f0.jpg","title":"20241013_Pagodas_of_Shousheng_Temple_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20241013_Pagodas_of_Shousheng_Temple_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3b/20241013_Pagodas_of_Shousheng_Temple_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​寿圣寺双塔","width":320,"height":480}}